  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed single storey rear extension, by reason of its depth, roof design, scale and location would result in a bulky, obtrusive and incongruous addition which would harm the living conditions of the adjoining neighbour, No.4 Edensor Road, as well as having an adverse effect on the visual amenities of the locality. Thus, making it contrary to adopted Local Plan Policies CC1, CC2, CC4, SC7 and the intent of the Residential Extension Guidelines Supplementary Planning Document May 2024, policies of London Plan and the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed rear roof extension, by reason of its design, scale and size would result in a bulky, obtrusive and incongruous addition, would be out of scale and character with this and surrounding dwellings, as well as having an adverse effect on the visual amenities of the locality. Thus, it is contrary to Local Plan policies SC7, CC1, CC2 and CC4 of Local Plan, policies of London Plan and the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Reason : 3 - The proposed front boundary gate would, by reason of its height and design, would not retain the character of the street and harm the character and appearance of the conservation area, in addition would not comply with the Council's Residential Crossovers and Off-Street Parking Policy October 2016 and would not ensure visibility is retained and would harm pedestrian and vehicle safety. Thus, it is contrary to Local Plan policies SC7, CC1, CC2, CC4 and EC2 of Local Plan, policies of London Plan and the National Planning Policy Framework."
  ],
